{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"何西阿書","commonName":"何西阿書","title":"何西阿書","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"1390c0b166f5f648615cbddd0fc0981a1b1280f32e03791ade9afbe66f074180","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["對以色列的最後審判"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以法蓮支派在以色列地位崇高，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們一開口，人都恐懼顫抖。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他們卻祭拜巴力，以致犯罪而亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今他們作惡日甚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為自己鑄造神像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用銀子精工製作偶像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但這統統不過是匠人之作。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人們議論他們說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「那些獻祭的人竟親吻牛犢偶像！」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們像晨霧，如轉瞬即逝的朝露，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像麥場上飛旋而去的糠秕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像窗口冒出的輕煙。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「自從你們離開埃及以來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就是你們的上帝耶和華。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除我以外，你們不可有別的神明；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我以外，你們也沒有別的救主。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我曾在乾旱的曠野照顧你們，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你們得到餵養，便得飽足。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們飽足以後，就心高氣傲，忘記了我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我要像獅子攻擊你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如豹子潛伏在路旁；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要像一頭失了幼崽的母熊衝向你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撕裂你們的胸膛；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要像母獅吞噬你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像兇猛的野獸撕碎你們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"「以色列啊，你要滅亡了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你抵擋我，抵擋你的幫助者。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾求我為你設立君王和首領，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在拯救你的君王在哪裡呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在各城管理你的首領在哪裡呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在憤怒中賜給你君王，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也在憤怒中廢黜他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"「以法蓮的過犯已被記錄在冊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的罪惡已被儲存入庫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"臨產的陣痛要臨到他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他是毫無智慧的孩子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"分娩之時卻不離開母腹。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要解救他們脫離陰間的權勢嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要救贖他們脫離死亡嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"死亡啊，你的災殃在哪裡？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"陰間啊，你的毀滅在哪裡？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不施憐憫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"儘管以法蓮在眾弟兄中最強盛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從耶和華而來的東風要從沙漠颳來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使清泉枯竭，水井乾涸。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他儲藏的一切珍寶都要被擄去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撒瑪利亞人背叛了他們的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要擔當自己的罪過。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們將喪身刀下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的孩子要被摔死，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"孕婦要被剖腹。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}